      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 19a of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(4) A copy of every detention order made by the Board under subsection (1) shall as soon as may be after the making of the order be served on the person to whom it relates, and every such person shall be entitled to make representations to an Advisory Board constituted under Clause (2) of Article 151 of the Federal Constitution in accordance with the prescribed procedures.”. Amendment of section 19c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 19c of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words “subsection 15(4)” the words “subsection 15(3)”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (4)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “subsection 15(4)” the words “subsection 15(3)”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “subsection 15(3)” the words “subsection (3)”. Substitution of sections 19e and 19f"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for sections 19e and 19f the following sections: “Power to order removal 19e. (1) The Board may by order direct the removal from any place of detention to another place of detention to be specified in such order of any person detained under section 19a to be there detained for the whole or any part of such period for which it has been ordered that such person shall be detained. (2) Any person who is in the course of removal under subsection (1) shall be deemed to be in lawful custody. Power to order production of detained person 19f. (1) On proof to his satisfaction that the presence at any place of any person detained under section 19a, or lawfully in the custody of the police or confined in any prison whether under section 19a or under an order of any court or otherwise howsoever, and notwithstanding any order of any court or other authority whatsoever, is required in the interests of justice, or for the purpose of any public or other inquiry, or in the national interest, or in the interests of the person detained, in custody, or confined, the Commissioner General of Prison where the person is detained in a place of detention or prison, or the Inspector General of Police where the person is in the lawful custody of the police, may order that such person be taken to that place. (2) Any person in the course of being taken to any place under subsection (1) and whilst at such place shall be kept in such custody as the Commissioner General of Prison or the Inspector General of Police, as the case may be, may direct and whilst in that custody shall be deemed to be in lawful custody. (3) In this section, “Commissioner General of Prison” has the same meaning assigned to it by subsection 2(1) of the Prison Act 1995 [Act 537].”. New section 19g"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 19f the following section: “Saving in respect of prosecution of persons detained 19g. The detention of any person under this Part shall be without prejudice to the taking of any criminal proceeding against that person, whether during or after the period of his detention.”. Amendment of section 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
