      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Prevention of Crime (Amendment) Act 2015."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of long title"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Prevention of Crime Act 1959 [Act 297], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in the long title by inserting after the words “secret societies” the words “, terrorists”. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 2(1) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the definition of “Registrar” the following definition: ‘ “terrorist” has the same meaning assigned to it by the Penal Code [Act 574].’. Amendment of section 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 3 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) When a person is arrested under subsection (1), the case shall be referred by the police officer to the Public Prosecutor for direction not later than seven days from the date of arrest.”. Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_5__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_5__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 4 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subparagraph (2)(a)(i), by deleting the words “or a Deputy Public Prosecutor”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2a) No person shall be arrested and detained under this section solely for his political belief or political activity.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_5__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsections: “(4) The Public Prosecutor may appear in any application made under this section. (5) For the purpose of this section, “political belief or political activity” means engaging in a lawful activity through— (a) the expression of an opinion or the pursuit of a course of action made according to the tenets of a political party that is at the relevant time registered under the Societies Act 1966 [Act 335] as evidenced by— (i) membership of or contribution to that party; or (ii) open and active participation in the affairs of that party; (b) the expression of an opinion directed towards any government in Malaysia; or (c) the pursuit of a course of action directed towards any government in Malaysia.”. Substitution of section 7b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_6__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_6__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_6__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 7b the following section: “Prevention of Crime Board 7b. (1) A Prevention of Crime Board is established which shall consist of the following members to be appointed by the Yang di-Pertuan Agong: (a) a Chairman, who shall be a legally qualified person with at least fifteen years experience in the legal field; (b) a Deputy Chairman; and (c) not less than three and not more than six other members. (2) Every member of the Board shall, unless he sooner resigns, hold office for a period not exceeding three years and is eligible for re-appointment once for another period of three years. (3) Every member of the Board may at any time resign his office by giving notice in writing to the Yang di-Pertuan Agong. (4) The appointment of any member of the Board may at any time be revoked by the Yang di-Pertuan Agong. (5) The quorum for any sitting of the Board shall be three members. (6) Subject to this Act, the Board shall determine its own procedure. (7) Every member of the Board shall be deemed to be a public servant within the meaning of the Penal Code.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_6__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding subsection (1), the members of the Board holding office immediately before the coming into operation of this section shall be deemed to have been appointed under the amended section 7b, shall continue to hold office until the expiry of their existing period of appointment and shall be eligible for re-appointment in accordance with the amended subsection 7b(2). Amendment of section 9"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_7__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 9 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (6), by deleting the words “or a Deputy Public Prosecutor”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_7__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (6) the following subsection: “(7) The Minister may by regulations prescribe the allowances to be paid to witnesses summoned under subsection (3).”. Amendment of section 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/8/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
